 "notes": "Blender 'Toy' column = the Lego scene (official README teaser is lego; run_blender.sh default SCENE=lego). Baseline 3DGS is the authors' own rerun: 40k iterations, visual-hull init (300k pts), mask loss 0.1, densification until 45k (i.e. whole run), no opacity reset; it is also the stage-1 run whose point cloud initializes SplatFields. Test = all 200 transforms_test.json views at 800x800, white background; PSNR = mean of per-image PSNR on 8-bit renders. No Mip-NeRF 360 / T&T / DB / LLFF numbers in the paper. 4D (Owlii, NeRF-DS) results are out of scope. 3-scene subset used here (chair, hotdog, ficus) at 6 views: SplatFields3D mean 24.49 vs 3DGS 22.05 = +2.44 dB (not the 8-scene +1.64); at 12 views 27.71 vs 26.84 = +0.87. Compare per scene."
